{
  "author": "KC桌面",
  "content": "<section style=\"margin:0 0 22px;padding:18px 16px;border-left:5px solid #C9A227;background:#F7F3E8\"><p style=\"margin:0 0 8px;color:#7A5B12;font-size:14px;font-weight:700\">KC桌面——外资精译</p><p style=\"margin:0;color:#142033;font-size:21px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.4\">摩根士丹利：研究主题与行业变化观察</p></section>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">截至7月26日当周，MS中国房地产周度数据库显示，50城新房周度备案成交同比下滑<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">4%</span>，较前一周的同比正增长<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">3%</span>出现方向性变化。同期10城二手房备案成交同比增长<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">5%</span>，延续了此前一周<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">6%</span>的增速。新房与二手房成交走势的分化，在7月最后一周进一步放大。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">这份周度追踪报告覆盖了截至7月26日的数据窗口。新房成交的同比转负，主要受二线城市影响：二线城市周度成交同比下滑<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">11%</span>，而前一周为增长<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">14%</span>。一线城市和三线城市则分别录得<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">13%</span>和<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">9%</span>的同比正增长。从年初至今累计看，50城新房成交仍为同比下滑<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">11%</span>。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOUgWlKiaJzGdCfgg3F1J0HPnb65ApMgj0cial98ufWjhrjeWUgc22ib1QQ1fQ9qhiaWias9UboRTz0XL8vo0Thfv0DgcgagGlHEhWrQ/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"研报原图 1\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></p>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOVMPiaYIUlbSiccoaKJB8o7XxutU55fyNmkia8gmB9vEbwmaDOw64mq1BD4LHQVfYnHJoxYlflDSlzHdaddMV9YFEuh0ShArj8VQI/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"研报原图 2\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></p>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">二手房方面，10城整体周度成交同比增长<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">5%</span>，其中一线城市增长<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">6%</span>，二线城市增长<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">4%</span>。年初至今累计，10城二手房成交同比正增长<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">4%</span>。新房与二手房的累计增速差距已扩大至15个百分点。</p>\n<section style=\"margin:18px 0;padding:13px 15px;background:#F1F8F4;border-left:4px solid #2F8F5B;color:#223044;font-size:15px;line-height:1.75\"><strong><span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">KC评论</span>：</strong> 新房与二手房成交增速的持续分化，提示市场结构正在发生变化。二手房挂牌量增加和议价空间扩大，可能分流了部分新房需求。这份报告中的二线城市新房成交周度波动较大，从增长<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">14%</span>到下滑<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">11%</span>仅用了一周时间，样本量有限，但方向性变化值得关注。</section>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">另一个值得关注的指标是整体去化率。当周50城新房整体去化率为<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">50%</span>，较前一周的<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">26%</span>大幅<span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700\">回升</span>。其中一线城市去化率从<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">4%</span>跃升至<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">52%</span>，二线城市从<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">48%</span>微升至<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">49%</span>。一线城市去化率的剧烈波动，可能与当周推盘结构和个别项目集中网签有关，而非需求端的系统性改善。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">中原地产六城二手房挂牌价跟踪指数当周录得<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">16.0%</span>的同比降幅，较前一周的<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">16.5%</span>略有收窄。一线城市中介指数从52.8微升至53.3，仍处于历史低位区间。价格信号尚未出现趋势性变化。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOVO2TDV7CeVSEjV52UOYia7zOmsR6cwjM569ZfKTpiciaEEPnmm9Y7MTwP8lEy7O5XDgpeyKe8lNN8zMbkcSLFSP3ujMhC80RfDQY/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"摩根士丹利：研究主题与行业变化观察：截至7月26日当周，MS中国房地产周度数据库显示，50城新房周度备案成交同比下滑4%，较前一周的同比正增长3%出现方向性变化。\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></p>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">这份周度数据报告的核心信息是：新房市场在7月最后一周出现边际变化，二手房成交保持相对<span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700\">韧性</span>，但价格仍在调整通道中。对于关注中国房地产市场的读者而言，后续几周的新房成交能否企稳，以及二手房挂牌价指数是否继续收窄降幅，将是判断市场变化的关键观察点。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">&lt;p style=\"color:#999999;font-size:12px;\"&gt;For informational purposes only. Portions may be generated,translated,summarized,or edited with AI assistance based on source materials and may contain omissions or errors. Please verify independently. This is not investment,legal,tax,accounting,or other professional advice.&lt;/p&gt;</p>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">&lt;p style=\"color:#999999;font-size:12px;</p>\n<p style=\"margin:28px 0 0;padding-top:12px;border-top:1px solid #D9DEE7;color:#8A93A3;font-size:12px;line-height:1.6\">For informational purposes only. Portions may be generated, translated, summarized, or edited with AI assistance based on source materials and may contain omissions or errors. Please verify independently. This is not investment, legal, tax, accounting, or other professional advice.</p>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOX4UicrOSN72EvFHaYIEKp9Dhvb2tPzAibBDDNk6SD2Wt1BfsDdoLiaR6T90eKia4uhibO1THljUdURVPaXDt4ScSJCuL481X96IzibI/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"KC Desk\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></p>\n<p style=\"margin:16px 0 0;color:#A3ABB8;font-size:12px;line-height:1.55;text-align:left\">Original report: 43-MS-China Property-Weekly Database Tracker -30-260727</p>\n<p style=\"margin:16px 0 0;padding:14px 16px;background:#EAF2FB;border-left:4px solid #2E6FB7;color:#152033;font-size:15px;line-height:1.75;font-weight:600\">更新信息参见ΚСⅾеѕk․сοｍ</p>",
